    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Capture Destroy (KCD) is a real-time strategy and combat game that combines the intensity of military vehicle gameplay with the depth of strategy and simulation. It gives you control not just over the battlefield, but over the politics and government decisions driving the wars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In KCD, the fusion of simulation and combat offers a seamless gameplay experience that you need to play to fully appreciate. You\u2019ll build and research advanced technology and infrastructure, shaping the fate of your faction. Prosper, and your faction will thrive. Fail, and your territory could descend into civil war, forcing you to battle your own population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a procedural, agent-based AI system, ensuring every playthrough is dynamic and unique. Combat spans large, immersive maps, covering air, sea, and ground engagements. Real-time naval warfare meshes with mission-based ground and air combat, giving players a variety of military tactics to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic decisions extend beyond the battlefield\u2014you must choose whether to engage in or skip critical missions. Success brings progress, but failure can lead to protracted, resource-draining wars that erode popular support, making it increasingly difficult to maintain control over your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the air, land, and sea command and Control over 400 vehicles and 300 unique bombs and missiles. <strong>Thousand</strong> of sub-variants of combat vehicles, jets, and ship across 67 classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/18e92f90d24a70651d765ffa0eff66d8.avif?t=1731105073\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span>Radar Systems, jamming, and electronic warfare are all detailed modelled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/b901a162fb6fe9717bdc7ad1f5efbf4e.poster.avif?t=1731105073\" width=800 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/b901a162fb6fe9717bdc7ad1f5efbf4e.webm?t=1731105073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/b901a162fb6fe9717bdc7ad1f5efbf4e.mp4?t=1731105073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air bust Damage modeling fragments and penetrations are simulated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/6a121ac3571256e5d71cea3722f9abb8.poster.avif?t=1731105073\" width=800 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/6a121ac3571256e5d71cea3722f9abb8.webm?t=1731105073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/6a121ac3571256e5d71cea3722f9abb8.mp4?t=1731105073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original 3d Artwork, I created dozens of high-quality models and commissioned more from talented artists.<br> see more of the artwork.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/5ba20e75cae04ffa38a03a62f63646d6.avif?t=1731105073\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/6563e86710e936d03c8e1ee3c1853076.avif?t=1731105073\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Cockpits with interactive MFD screens.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/8ca97aabce0a66cffa22cca9c1bce2c6.avif?t=1731105073\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/70250fe93588ccb3a3723d67cc6de1fd.avif?t=1731105073\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Orginal Work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/2b242b9ab7d4a690748bdfed25156365.avif?t=1731105073\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/671b79c21b1bc4c1fc8acf3afc02a4e9.avif?t=1731105073\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/fb33e0c713cc92587ab11670e501abb3.avif?t=1731105073\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Capture Destroy (KCD) is a real-time strategy and combat game that combines the intensity of military vehicle gameplay with the depth of strategy and simulation. It gives you control not just over the battlefield, but over the politics and government decisions driving the wars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In KCD, the fusion of simulation and combat offers a seamless gameplay experience that you need to play to fully appreciate. You\u2019ll build and research advanced technology and infrastructure, shaping the fate of your faction. Prosper, and your faction will thrive. Fail, and your territory could descend into civil war, forcing you to battle your own population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a procedural, agent-based AI system, ensuring every playthrough is dynamic and unique. Combat spans large, immersive maps, covering air, sea, and ground engagements. Real-time naval warfare meshes with mission-based ground and air combat, giving players a variety of military tactics to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic decisions extend beyond the battlefield\u2014you must choose whether to engage in or skip critical missions. Success brings progress, but failure can lead to protracted, resource-draining wars that erode popular support, making it increasingly difficult to maintain control over your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the air, land, and sea command and Control over 400 vehicles and 300 unique bombs and missiles. <strong>Thousand</strong> of sub-variants of combat vehicles, jets, and ship across 67 classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581100/extras/18e92f90d24a70651d765ffa0eff66d8.avif?t=1731105073\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span>Radar Systems, jamming, and electronic warfare are all detailed